#: ../../../CIR/EmitPoints.md:1
msgid "ClangIR Emit Points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/EmitPoints.md:3
msgid ""
"`-cc1 -emit-cir` prints CIR after the CIR-to-CIR pipeline. `-emit-"
"cir=<keyword>` stops at an earlier point. A keyword names a condition of the "
"emitted CIR, not a pass."
msgstr ""

