msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/EmitPoints.md:0
msgid "CIRGen's output; no ClangIR pass has run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/EmitPoints.md:11
msgid "ClangIR input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/EmitPoints.md:13
msgid ""
"`-cc1` accepts CIR as input (`.cir` or `-x cir`) and runs the full CIR-to-"
"CIR pipeline on it, whichever point it was emitted at. The passes are safe "
"to rerun. `-clangir-disable-passes` skips the pipeline."
msgstr ""
